Write an accepted proposal into a stored draft. Refused if the draft's text has changed since the proposal was made. Signature and forward header stay as they are

Usage: mxr compose apply [OPTIONS] --draft <DRAFT_ID> <PROPOSAL_ID>

Arguments:
  <PROPOSAL_ID>  Proposal id from `mxr compose assist`; proposals last 30 minutes

Options:
      --draft <DRAFT_ID>  The stored draft to write into
      --format <FORMAT>   [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help              Print help
